Calling frontmatter-update with values already present in the file prints no diff and exits 0.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
key: value
---
# Plan
Body content.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md key=value
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: key=value
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
key: value
---
# Plan
Body content.
